{"seq":2,"slug":"navigation-routing-patterns","title":"导航与路由模式","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/mobile-architecture-patterns/cross-cutting/navigation-routing-patterns","wordCount":856,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"导航与路由模式\">导航与路由模式</h1><p>移动应用的导航看似简单——用户点击跳转到下一个页面——但在架构层面，它是最容易引入隐式耦合的地方。如果 Feature A 的代码中直接 <code>import FeatureB</code> 来实例化目标页面，模块化的隔离边界就被导航打破了。现代移动导航架构的核心目标是：<strong>让发起导航的模块不需要知道目标页面的具体类型。</strong></p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>三层抽象</strong>：业务层决定&quot;何时跳转&quot;、路由层决定&quot;跳到哪&quot;、框架层执行&quot;怎么跳&quot;——发起方不需要知道目标页面类型</li>\n<li><strong>路由契约解耦模块</strong>：Feature 模块通过路由标识符（类型安全路由 / 字符串 URI）而非直接 import 目标页面</li>\n<li><strong>Deep Link 统一</strong>：外部 URL 和应用内导航共用同一张路由表，消除二义性</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"导航的三层抽象\">导航的三层抽象</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    subgraph 业务层&#10;        VM[ViewModel/Presenter] --&gt;|&quot;navigateTo(route)&quot;| NI[Navigator 接口]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 路由层&#10;        NI --&gt; Router[Router 实现&lt;br/&gt;路由表解析]&#10;        Router --&gt;|匹配路由| Factory[页面工厂]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 框架层&#10;        Factory --&gt; NC[NavController / NavigationStack]&#10;    end\">graph TD\n    subgraph 业务层\n        VM[ViewModel/Presenter] --&gt;|\"navigateTo(route)\"| NI[Navigator 接口]\n    end\n    subgraph 路由层\n        NI --&gt; Router[Router 实现&lt;br/&gt;路由表解析]\n        Router --&gt;|匹配路由| Factory[页面工厂]\n    end\n    subgraph 框架层\n        Factory --&gt; NC[NavController / NavigationStack]\n    end</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>层</th>\n<th>职责</th>\n<th>知道什么</th>\n<th>不知道什么</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>业务层</td>\n<td>决定&quot;什么时候跳转&quot;</td>\n<td>路由标识符（字符串/类型）</td>\n<td>目标页面的具体实现</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>路由层</td>\n<td>决定&quot;跳转到哪个页面&quot;</td>\n<td>路由注册表</td>\n<td>业务逻辑</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>框架层</td>\n<td>执行&quot;怎么跳转&quot;</td>\n<td>平台导航 API</td>\n<td>业务含义</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"android-jetpack-navigation-compose\">Android：Jetpack Navigation Compose</h2><p>Android 官方的 Navigation Compose 从 2024 年开始支持类型安全路由（Type-safe Navigation），2026 年已成为标准实践：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"// 路由定义（类型安全，编译期检查）&#10;@Serializable&#10;data class ProductDetailRoute(val productId: String)&#10;&#10;@Serializable&#10;data object ProductListRoute&#10;&#10;@Serializable&#10;data class CheckoutRoute(val cartId: String, val couponCode: String? = null)&#10;&#10;// NavHost 声明&#10;@Composable&#10;fun AppNavHost(navController: NavHostController = rememberNavController()) {&#10;    NavHost(navController, startDestination = ProductListRoute) {&#10;        composable&lt;ProductListRoute&gt; {&#10;            ProductListScreen(&#10;                onProductClick = { productId -&gt;&#10;                    navController.navigate(ProductDetailRoute(productId))&#10;                }&#10;            )&#10;        }&#10;        composable&lt;ProductDetailRoute&gt; { backStackEntry -&gt;&#10;            val route = backStackEntry.toRoute&lt;ProductDetailRoute&gt;()&#10;            ProductDetailScreen(productId = route.productId)&#10;        }&#10;        composable&lt;CheckoutRoute&gt; { backStackEntry -&gt;&#10;            val route = backStackEntry.toRoute&lt;CheckoutRoute&gt;()&#10;            CheckoutScreen(cartId = route.cartId, coupon = route.couponCode)&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 路由定义（类型安全，编译期检查）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>@Serializable</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>data class ProductDetailRoute(val productId: String)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>@Serializable</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>data object ProductListRoute</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>@Serializable</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>data class CheckoutRoute(val cartId: String, val couponCode: String? = null)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// NavHost 声明</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>@Composable</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fun AppNavHost(navController: NavHostController = rememberNavController()) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    NavHost(navController, startDestination = ProductListRoute) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        composable&#x3C;ProductListRoute> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            ProductListScreen(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                onProductClick = { productId -></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                    navController.navigate(ProductDetailRoute(productId))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        composable&#x3C;ProductDetailRoute> { backStackEntry -></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            val route = backStackEntry.toRoute&#x3C;ProductDetailRoute>()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            ProductDetailScreen(productId = route.productId)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        composable&#x3C;CheckoutRoute> { backStackEntry -></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            val route = backStackEntry.toRoute&#x3C;CheckoutRoute>()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            CheckoutScreen(cartId = route.cartId, coupon = route.couponCode)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"模块化项目中的导航\">模块化项目中的导航</h3><p>在模块化项目中，各 Feature 模块不应直接依赖 <code>NavController</code>。推荐模式是在 core 模块定义导航契约：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"// core-navigation 模块&#10;interface AppNavigator {&#10;    fun navigateToProductDetail(productId: String)&#10;    fun navigateToCheckout(cartId: String)&#10;    fun navigateBack()&#10;}&#10;&#10;// :app 模块实现&#10;class AppNavigatorImpl(private val navController: NavHostController) : AppNavigator {&#10;    override fun navigateToProductDetail(productId: String) {&#10;        navController.navigate(ProductDetailRoute(productId))&#10;    }&#10;    override fun navigateToCheckout(cartId: String) {&#10;        navController.navigate(CheckoutRoute(cartId))&#10;    }&#10;    override fun navigateBack() {&#10;        navController.popBackStack()&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// core-navigation 模块</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>interface AppNavigator {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fun navigateToProductDetail(productId: String)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fun navigateToCheckout(cartId: String)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fun navigateBack()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// :app 模块实现</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>class AppNavigatorImpl(private val navController: NavHostController) : AppNavigator {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    override fun navigateToProductDetail(productId: String) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        navController.navigate(ProductDetailRoute(productId))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    override fun navigateToCheckout(cartId: String) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        navController.navigate(CheckoutRoute(cartId))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    override fun navigateBack() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        navController.popBackStack()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"ios-navigationstack-与-coordinator\">iOS：NavigationStack 与 Coordinator</h2><p>SwiftUI 的 <code>NavigationStack</code>（iOS 16+）提供了 value-based 导航——通过操作一个路径数组来控制导航栈：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"swift\" data-code=\"// 路由枚举&#10;enum AppRoute: Hashable {&#10;    case productDetail(productId: String)&#10;    case checkout(cartId: String)&#10;    case settings&#10;}&#10;&#10;// NavigationStack + path&#10;struct ContentView: View {&#10;    @State private var path = NavigationPath()&#10;&#10;    var body: some View {&#10;        NavigationStack(path: $path) {&#10;            ProductListView(onProductTap: { id in&#10;                path.append(AppRoute.productDetail(productId: id))&#10;            })&#10;            .navigationDestination(for: AppRoute.self) { route in&#10;                switch route {&#10;                case .productDetail(let id):&#10;                    ProductDetailView(productId: id)&#10;                case .checkout(let cartId):&#10;                    CheckoutView(cartId: cartId)&#10;                case .settings:&#10;                    SettingsView()&#10;                }&#10;            }&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 路由枚举</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">enum</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> AppRoute</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">Hashable</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    case</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> productDetail</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(productId: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">String</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    case</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> checkout</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(cartId: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">String</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    case</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> settings</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// NavigationStack + path</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">struct</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ContentView</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">View </span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    @State</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> private</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> var</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> path </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> NavigationPath</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    var</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> body: </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">some</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> View {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        NavigationStack</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">path</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: $path) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">            ProductListView</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">onProductTap</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">                path.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">append</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(AppRoute.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">productDetail</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">productId</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: id))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            })</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            .</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">navigationDestination</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: AppRoute.</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) { route </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">                switch</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> route {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">                case</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> .</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">productDetail</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> id)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">                    ProductDetailView</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">productId</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: id)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">                case</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> .</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">checkout</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> cartId)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">                    CheckoutView</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">cartId</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: cartId)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">                case</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> .settings</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">                    SettingsView</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">                }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"coordinator-模式\">Coordinator 模式</h3><p>对于复杂导航流（如多步骤结账、认证流程），Coordinator 模式将导航逻辑从 View/ViewModel 中提取到专门的协调者：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"swift\" data-code=\"// Coordinator 协议&#10;protocol Coordinator: AnyObject {&#10;    var childCoordinators: [Coordinator] { get set }&#10;    func start()&#10;}&#10;&#10;// 结账流 Coordinator&#10;class CheckoutCoordinator: Coordinator {&#10;    var childCoordinators: [Coordinator] = []&#10;    private let navigationPath: Binding&lt;NavigationPath&gt;&#10;&#10;    func start() {&#10;        navigationPath.wrappedValue.append(CheckoutStep.cart)&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    func proceedToPayment() {&#10;        navigationPath.wrappedValue.append(CheckoutStep.payment)&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    func proceedToConfirmation(orderId: String) {&#10;        navigationPath.wrappedValue.append(CheckoutStep.confirmation(orderId))&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    func finish() {&#10;        // 清除整个结账流的导航栈&#10;        navigationPath.wrappedValue.removeLast(navigationPath.wrappedValue.count)&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// Coordinator 协议</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">protocol</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Coordinator</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">AnyObject</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    var</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> childCoordinators: [Coordinator] { </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">get</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> set</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    func</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> start</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 结账流 Coordinator</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> CheckoutCoordinator</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Coordinator </span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    var</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> childCoordinators: [Coordinator] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> []</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    private</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> navigationPath: Binding&#x3C;NavigationPath></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    func</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> start</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        navigationPath.wrappedValue.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">append</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(CheckoutStep.cart)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    func</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> proceedToPayment</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        navigationPath.wrappedValue.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">append</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(CheckoutStep.payment)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    func</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> proceedToConfirmation</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">orderId</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">String</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        navigationPath.wrappedValue.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">append</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(CheckoutStep.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">confirmation</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(orderId))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    func</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> finish</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">        // 清除整个结账流的导航栈</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        navigationPath.wrappedValue.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">removeLast</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(navigationPath.wrappedValue.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">count</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"deep-link-统一路由\">Deep Link 统一路由</h2><p>Deep link（URL scheme / Universal Link / App Link）需要将外部 URL 映射到应用内路由。统一路由表是解决这个问题的关键：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"// 统一路由表&#10;object DeepLinkRouter {&#10;    private val routes = listOf(&#10;        RoutePattern(&quot;myapp://product/{id}&quot;) { params -&gt;&#10;            ProductDetailRoute(productId = params[&quot;id&quot;]!!)&#10;        },&#10;        RoutePattern(&quot;myapp://checkout/{cartId}&quot;) { params -&gt;&#10;            CheckoutRoute(cartId = params[&quot;cartId&quot;]!!)&#10;        },&#10;        RoutePattern(&quot;https://myapp.com/product/{id}&quot;) { params -&gt;&#10;            ProductDetailRoute(productId = params[&quot;id&quot;]!!)&#10;        }&#10;    )&#10;&#10;    fun resolve(uri: Uri): Any? {&#10;        return routes.firstNotNullOfOrNull { it.match(uri) }&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 统一路由表</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>object DeepLinkRouter {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private val routes = listOf(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        RoutePattern(\"myapp://product/{id}\") { params -></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            ProductDetailRoute(productId = params[\"id\"]!!)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        RoutePattern(\"myapp://checkout/{cartId}\") { params -></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            CheckoutRoute(cartId = params[\"cartId\"]!!)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        RoutePattern(\"https://myapp.com/product/{id}\") { params -></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            ProductDetailRoute(productId = params[\"id\"]!!)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fun resolve(uri: Uri): Any? {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        return routes.firstNotNullOfOrNull { it.match(uri) }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>URL 类型</th>\n<th>Android</th>\n<th>iOS</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Custom Scheme (<code>myapp://</code>)</td>\n<td>Intent Filter</td>\n<td>URL Scheme in Info.plist</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Universal Link (<code>https://</code>)</td>\n<td>App Links (assetlinks.json)</td>\n<td>Associated Domains</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>延迟深链（安装后首次打开）</td>\n<td>Firebase Dynamic Links / Branch</td>\n<td>同</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"导航状态的持久化与恢复\">导航状态的持久化与恢复</h2><p>Android 的进程恢复（Process Death）和 iOS 的状态恢复（State Restoration）要求导航状态可序列化：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>导航状态</mtext><mo>=</mo><mtext>栈中所有路由</mtext><mo>+</mo><mtext>每个路由的参数</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{导航状态} = \\text{栈中所有路由} + \\text{每个路由的参数}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">导航状态</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">栈中所有路由</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">每个路由的参数</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><ul>\n<li>Android：<code>NavController</code> 自动将 back stack 保存到 <code>SavedStateHandle</code></li>\n<li>iOS：<code>NavigationPath</code> 支持 <code>Codable</code>，可存入 <code>UserDefaults</code> 或 <code>SceneStorage</code></li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"swift\" data-code=\"// iOS 导航状态持久化&#10;@SceneStorage(&quot;navigation&quot;) private var navigationData: Data?&#10;&#10;var body: some View {&#10;    NavigationStack(path: $path) { ... }&#10;        .onAppear {&#10;            if let data = navigationData {&#10;                path = try? JSONDecoder().decode(NavigationPath.CodableRepresentation.self, from: data)&#10;                    .map { NavigationPath($0) } ?? NavigationPath()&#10;            }&#10;        }&#10;        .onChange(of: path) { _, newPath in&#10;            navigationData = try? JSONEncoder().encode(newPath.codable)&#10;        }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// iOS 导航状态持久化</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">@SceneStorage</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"navigation\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">private</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> var</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> navigationData: Data</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">var</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> body: </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">some</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> View {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    NavigationStack</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">path</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: $path) { </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">...</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        .</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">onAppear</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">            if</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> data </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> navigationData {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">                path </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> try?</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> JSONDecoder</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">().</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">decode</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(NavigationPath.CodableRepresentation.</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: data)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">                    .</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">map</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">NavigationPath</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">$0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">??</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> NavigationPath</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        .</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">onChange</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">of</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: path) { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">_</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, newPath </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            navigationData </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> try?</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> JSONEncoder</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">().</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">encode</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(newPath.codable)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"导航测试策略\">导航测试策略</h2><p>导航逻辑应该可以在不启动 UI 的情况下测试：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"// 测试导航决策（不需要真实 NavController）&#10;class ProductListNavigationTest {&#10;    private val fakeNavigator = FakeAppNavigator()&#10;    private val viewModel = ProductListViewModel(&#10;        navigator = fakeNavigator,&#10;        useCase = FakeGetProductsUseCase()&#10;    )&#10;&#10;    @Test&#10;    fun `clicking product navigates to detail`() {&#10;        viewModel.onEvent(ProductListEvent.ProductClicked(&quot;product-123&quot;))&#10;        assertEquals(&quot;product-123&quot;, fakeNavigator.lastNavigatedProductId)&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 测试导航决策（不需要真实 NavController）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>class ProductListNavigationTest {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private val fakeNavigator = FakeAppNavigator()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private val viewModel = ProductListViewModel(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        navigator = fakeNavigator,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        useCase = FakeGetProductsUseCase()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    @Test</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fun `clicking product navigates to detail`() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        viewModel.onEvent(ProductListEvent.ProductClicked(\"product-123\"))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        assertEquals(\"product-123\", fakeNavigator.lastNavigatedProductId)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>导航是将 <a href=\"../modern-patterns/modularization-strategies\">模块化策略</a> 落地的关键环节——Feature 模块通过路由契约而非直接引用完成跳转。同时，导航状态是 <a href=\"state-management-mobile\">状态管理</a> 的一个特殊子集——它需要跨屏幕持久化、响应系统事件（返回键、Deep Link），并与 UI 状态保持一致。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>移动端导航的核心挑战不是&quot;怎么跳转到下一个页面&quot;，而是&quot;如何在模块化架构中让发起方和目标方互不感知&quot;。Android Navigation Compose 的类型安全路由和 iOS NavigationStack 的 value-based 导航是 2026 年两大平台的标准方案。Coordinator 模式为复杂多步骤流程提供了导航逻辑的集中管理。无论选什么方案，导航状态的可序列化（支持进程恢复）和 Deep Link 的统一路由表是不可绕过的工程要求。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"导航与路由模式","id":"导航与路由模式"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"导航的三层抽象","id":"导航的三层抽象"},{"level":2,"text":"Android：Jetpack Navigation Compose","id":"android-jetpack-navigation-compose"},{"level":3,"text":"模块化项目中的导航","id":"模块化项目中的导航"},{"level":2,"text":"iOS：NavigationStack 与 Coordinator","id":"ios-navigationstack-与-coordinator"},{"level":3,"text":"Coordinator 模式","id":"coordinator-模式"},{"level":2,"text":"Deep Link 统一路由","id":"deep-link-统一路由"},{"level":2,"text":"导航状态的持久化与恢复","id":"导航状态的持久化与恢复"},{"level":2,"text":"导航测试策略","id":"导航测试策略"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"移动端依赖注入","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/mobile-architecture-patterns/cross-cutting/dependency-injection-mobile"},"next":{"title":"移动端状态管理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/mobile-architecture-patterns/cross-cutting/state-management-mobile"}}